  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "orchestrator",
      "claim": "The anonymous-provider automation runs on llmgw-core's anonymous.Orchestrator. The gateway supplies the hooks: Enabled reads the effective setting; Enroll calls the unchanged ensureAnonymousProvider with its config and iam writes and cache invalidations; Claim takes the iam daily claim and declines if the provider changed, replacing the second enrollment check; Generation reads the iam generation; Record writes checks, model evidence and audit. Start runs hourly with the existing wake channel and auto-connect calls ConnectAll. The gateway run loop, scheduler, connect function, status and failure-code copies, gateway orchestrator constructor and probe selector are removed.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/api/anonymous_provider_automation.go; go/internal/providers anonymous adapters"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adapters",
      "claim": "AnonymousCatalog wraps the existing catalog refresh and keeps the upstream status on failure; AnonymousInvoker keeps the old probe paths and passes Retry-After through; EffectiveRegistry gives core the gateway's registry so profiles are vetted against the same list.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/providers anonymous adapter tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "differences",
      "claim": "A check cancelled at shutdown or by a disconnecting auto-connect client is no longer recorded as a failure and its models stay unverified until the next check, and auto-connect stops at the next provider; the post-claim enrollment check runs once; an evidence-store failure detail reads provider catalog failed while the failure code is unchanged.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/api anonymous automation tests"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "suite",
      "claim": "The full Go suite passes with HTTP_PROXY and HTTPS_PROXY unreachable with unchanged characterization goldens; the providers iam.* budget moves from 58 to 56; gofmt, vet, govulncheck (0 reachable), check-docs and git diff --check pass.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "local gate run on the reviewed head"
      }
    }
  ],
